  "expected_source": "declarative valid request facts and explicitly malformed grammar controls; no historical oracle import",
  "interpretation": [
    "Timezone syntax is literal + followed by four ASCII digits; negative offsets are malformed under frozen SPEC.",
    "No new calendar/minute/second/timezone-range validation is inferred beyond the explicit hour bound.",
    "Path ties use UTF-8 bytes, without normalization; quote/backslash paths are malformed as SPEC states.",
    "Byte counts have no stated numeric ceiling; aggregation uses arbitrary-precision decimal arithmetic.",
    "64 KiB means 65536 file bytes; no behavior is required for larger files."
  ],
  "cases": [
